  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Katiko BMU Livelihood Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector:Agriculture. Fishing. Beneficiaries:180 members, of which 100 are female. The project funds will be used to provide the BMU with support for administrative costs, capacity building and purchasing fishing equipment and gear. Funding will be used to conduct a market study, develop a business plan, training the group on value addition to their products, marketing, GOK fishing regulations and sustainable fishing requirements.</narrative>
  </description>
